    "title": "ASU Football's Creative Director Snags Viral Time-Lapse of Majestic Haboob at Sun Devil Stadium - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Aisha Khan ,\n14 hours ago A viral spectacle unfolded at Sun Devil Stadium this week, as Arizona State University football employees captured a massive dust storm, known as a haboob, rolling across the venue. The time-lapse, which has since captivated millions of viewers, was a confluence of nature's might and human resolve. Callum Norrie, ASU's director of creative video for the football team, quickly realized the potential for a striking time-lapse when he spotted the dust wall, which soared up to 8,000 feet, FOX 10 Phoenix reported. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
